TaskName Xi_Sib_Iron_0.0586_83.6_51.02_86_r0
PrimaryParticle Iron
PrimaryEnergy 0.05859 EeV
PrimaryZenAngle 83.63 deg
PrimaryAzimAngle 51.02 deg Magnetic
RandomSeed 0.098411816
